  "title": "Plum Bread",
  "description": "This is called a bread, but tastes more like a cake. I make this mostly during the holidays. The spices in this cake just lend themselves to eggnog and Christmas smells. You can bake this as a bundt cake, 4 small loaves, or 2 medium loaves.",
  "authors": [
    "v monte"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
